0027][\u0027arch\u0027]\u003d\u003d\u0027arm\u0027:\n\t\t\tarm\u003dTrue\n\t\tcore\u003dsystemInput[\u0027os\u0027][\u0027processors\u0027]\n\t\tfrequency\u003d\u0027\u0027\n\t\tdiskCapacity\u003dsystemInput[\u0027os\u0027][\u0027disk\u0027][\u0027total\u0027]/(1024*1024*1024)\n\t\tramCapacity\u003dsystemInput[\u0027memory\u0027][\u0027total\u0027]/(1024*1024*1024)\n\t\tos\u003dsystemInput[\u0027os\u0027][\u0027name\u0027]\n\t\tif \u0027windows\u0027 in os.lower():\n\t\t\tosType\u003d\u0027Windows\u0027\n\t\telif \u0027linux\u0027 in os.lower():\n\t\t\tosType\u003d\u0027Linux\u0027\n\t\telif \u0027mac\u0027 in os.lower():\n\t\t\tosType\u003d\u0027macOS\u0027\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tosType\u003d\u0027\u0027\n\t\tosVersion\u003dsystemInput[\u0027os\u0027][\u0027version\u0027]\n\t\tif \u0027wsl\u0027 in osVersion.lower():\n\t\t\tosVersion\u003d\u0027WSL (Container Env.)\u0027\n\t\tself.view.custom.params.config[\u0027resources\u0027]\u003d{\n\t\t\t\u0027cpu\u0027: {\n\t\t\t\t\u0027arm\u0027: arm,\n\t\t\t\t\u0027cores\u0027: core,\n\t\t\t\t\u0027frequency\u0027:2\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t\u0027disk\u0027: {\n\t\t\t\t\u0027capacity\u0027: diskCapacity\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t\u0027os\u0027: {\n\t\t\t\t\u0027type\u0027: osType,\n\t\t\t\t\u0027version\u0027: osVersion\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t\u0027ram\u0027: {\n\t\t\t\t\u0027capacity\u0027: ramCapacity\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\n"
                }
